CinnabarMay1_Text::
  .string "Sorry, excuse me...$"


CinnabarMay2_Text::
  .string "All those Gym badges...$"


CinnabarMay3_Text::
  .string "...I knew it, you're\n"
  .string "{COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}{COLOR RED}!\p"
  .string "{COLOR GREEN}Brendan{COLOR RED} talks about you very often;\n"
  .string "you seem to be a big motivator\l"
  .string "for him.\p"
  .string "Oh right! I'm {COLOR GREEN}May{COLOR RED}.\n"
  .string "{COLOR GREEN}Brendan{COLOR RED} and I both come from Hoenn.\p"
  .string "Well, I could use a warm-up before I\n"
  .string "face {COLOR GREEN}Blaine{COLOR RED}.$"


CinnabarMay4_Text::
  .string "I may as well see how skilled you\n"
  .string "are myself!$"


CinnabarMayDefeat_Text::
  .string "Woah, that was great!\n"
  .string "You lived up to the hype!$"


CinnabarMay5_Text::
  .string "I see why {COLOR GREEN}Brendan{COLOR RED} looks up\n"
  .string "to you now.\p"
  .string "I don't know if we'll bump into each\n"
  .string "other again, so please, have this.$"


