blaine_Text_EncounterText::
  .string "{COLOR BLUE}Hah!\p"
  .string "I am {COLOR GREEN}Blaine{COLOR BLUE}, the red-hot Leader\n"
  .string "of Cinnabar Gym!\p"
  .string "My fiery Pokémon are all rough\n"
  .string "and ready with intense heat!\p"
  .string "They incinerate all challengers!\p"
  .string "Hah!\n"
  .string "You better have Burn Heal!$"


blaine_Text_DefeatText::
  .string "I have burned down to nothing!\n"
  .string "Not even ashes remain!\p"
  .string "You have earned the Volcano Badge.$"


blaine_Text_Givetm::
  .string "TM38 contains Fire Blast.\n"
  .string "Teach it to Fire-type Pokémon.\p"
  .string "Special Attackers would be ideal\n"
  .string "for that move.$"


blaine_Text_TMInfomsg::
  .string "Hah! What a fight.\p"
  .string "Here, you can have this, too!$"


blaine_Text_Helloagain::
  .string "...You looking for a {COLOR GREEN}Charizardite Y{COLOR BLUE}?$"


blaine_Text_Perfectpokemon::
  .string "Show me a Pokémon with hefty\n"
  .string "Special Attack.\p"
  .string "Then, you'll earn a {COLOR GREEN}Charizardite Y{COLOR BLUE}!$"


blaine_Text_Helloagain2::
  .string "...You looking for a {COLOR GREEN}Charizardite X{COLOR BLUE}?$"


blaine_Text_Perfectpokemon2::
  .string "Show me a Pokémon with hefty\n"
  .string "Special Attack.\p"
  .string "Then, you'll earn a {COLOR GREEN}Charizardite X{COLOR BLUE}!$"


blaine_Text_Thepokemon::
  .string "Your {STR_VAR_1}...$"


blaine_Text_Notquite::
  .string "It's not enough, I'm afraid.$"


blaine_Text_Perfect::
  .string "Hah!\n"
  .string "That's what I wanna see!\p"
  .string "Well then, here it is.$"


blaine_Text_Donemsg::
  .string "Fire-types are to be used with\n"
  .string "utmost respect.\p"
  .string "Don't waste them on Water-types.$"


blaine_Text_Charmmsg::
  .string "This item makes special attacks\n"
  .string "even more fearsome.\p"
  .string "Take it as well.$"


jasmine_Text_1::
  .string "Hmm...{COLOR GREEN} Mega Aggron{COLOR RED} or {COLOR GREEN}Mega Steelix{COLOR RED}...$"


jasmine_Text_2::
  .string "Ah, hello.\p"
  .string "I've only recently acquainted myself\n"
  .string "with Mega Evolution, so I'm still\l"
  .string "figuring things out.$"


jasmine_Text_3::
  .string "Um, I'd like to practice, if you don't\n"
  .string "mind...$"


jasmine_Text_4::
  .string "Although I'm shy...\n"
  .string "Please don't take me lightly.$"


jasmine_Text_Defeat::
  .string "Well done...$"


jasmine_Text_6::
  .string "You have both skill and fortitude.\p"
  .string "Um... I think you'd like this.$"


jasmine_Text_7::
  .string "This item has helped me in count-\n"
  .string "less battles, although it can be a\l"
  .string "bit tricky to use.\p"
  .string "Try it for yourself.$"


jasmine_Text_Take::
  .string "I do have more to give, but...\p"
  .string "You'll have to show me a Pokémon\n"
  .string "forged in Defense.$"


jasmine_Text_8::
  .string "I think it could use more\n"
  .string "protection.\p"
  .string "No... I don't mean that kind...$"


jasmine_Text_Firstmon::
  .string "Your {STR_VAR_1}...$"


jasmine_Text_9::
  .string "Yes, this Pokémon is quite a\n"
  .string "worthy shield.\p"
  .string "As promised, here you go.$"


jasmine_Text_10::
  .string "{COLOR RED}The{COLOR GREEN} Assault Vest{COLOR RED} complements a high\n"
  .string "defense Pokémon well, making it an\l"
  .string "impenetrable wall.$"


