  .string "{COLOR GREEN}Eevee{COLOR BLUE} can evolve into one of eight\n"
  .string "kinds of Pokémon.$"


jasminere_Text_1::
  .string "{COLOR RED}Ah, welcome back.\n"
  .string "I hope you haven't returned\l"
  .string "hoping to destroy me in battle again.\p"
  .string "I've polished and learned a few new\n"
  .string "skills of my own.\p"
  .string "So, is that what you'd like?$"


jasminere_Text_2::
  .string "{COLOR RED}Hm, another loss, although it hurts\n"
  .string "less knowing you're the champion.\p"
  .string "I do feel like my battling prowess\n"
  .string "has improved, so thank you.\p"
  .string "This may assist you.$"


jasminere_Text_3::
  .string "{COLOR RED}And, if you'd like me to teach the move\n"
  .string "Steel Beam, talk to me!\p"
  .string "Keep it going, {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}.$"


