  .string "I know why {COLOR GREEN}Blaine{COLOR BLUE} became a\n"
  .string "Trainer.$"


CinnabarGym_Text_AceTrainer1_2::
  .string "Ow!$"


CinnabarGym_Text_AceTrainer1_3::
  .string "Our Leader, {COLOR GREEN}Blaine{COLOR BLUE}, became lost\n"
  .string "in the mountains but good.\p"
  .string "Night fell when a fiery bird\n"
  .string "Pokémon appeared.\p"
  .string "Its light allowed Blaine to find\n"
  .string "his way down safely.$"


CinnabarGym_Text_AceTrainer2_1::
